# .claude/handover.md — Template

> This file is written by each agent and read by the next agent in the workflow.
> It is gitignored — each task generates a fresh log.
> Handover notes are also posted as Jira comments and updated in Beads.

## Handover Log — [TICKET-ID]

### [from-agent] -> [to-agent]
Completed: [timestamp]
Status: [PASSED / PASSED WITH NOTES / BLOCKED]

What was done:
-

What was found:
-

What was fixed:
-

What the next agent needs to focus on:
-

Blockers (if any):
-

---

